WEBVTT

00:07.594 --> 00:10.214
<b>The carrots are as hard as iron.</b>

00:10.214 --> 00:13.674
<b>Having me cook was a mistake.</b>

00:13.674 --> 00:15.974
<b>How can you be so smug about it?</b>

00:15.974 --> 00:21.724
<b>Well, I didn't see the usual kitchen knife
anywhere. But more importantly...</b>

00:21.724 --> 00:26.064
<b>Cerberus is dead. I don't think there's
any question about that.</b>

00:26.064 --> 00:28.984
<b>So who was that impostor Fuubi-<i>san</i>?</b>

00:28.984 --> 00:33.694
<b>Suppose the one posing as that female
police detective was in fact Hel?</b>

00:33.694 --> 00:37.284
<b>Hel? But she didn't have any
shapeshifting capability.</b>

00:37.284 --> 00:41.334
<b>Androids are beings born
with something as their core.</b>

00:41.334 --> 00:46.374
<b>By taking over another's core,
they can inherit special capabilities.</b>

00:46.374 --> 00:50.844
<b>You mean that black stone.</b>

00:50.844 --> 00:53.884
<b>So are you saying Hel has inherited both
Cerberus's powers and his mission,</b>

00:53.884 --> 00:56.844
<b>and is now harvesting people's hearts?</b>

00:56.844 --> 01:02.814
<b>I wonder. Or it could be purely
for her own benefit.</b>

01:02.814 --> 01:06.984
<b>So they can mix and match
parts like dress-up dolls?</b>

01:06.984 --> 01:10.774
<b>They can. Because our
adversaries are androids.</b>

01:10.774 --> 01:13.904
<b>Nevertheless, it doesn't change
what needs to be done.</b>

01:13.904 --> 01:17.954
<b>We're going to put a stop
to this string of murders.</b>

01:17.954 --> 01:21.124
<b>Looks as though we'll be
busy starting tomorrow.</b>

01:21.124 --> 01:24.754
<b>That's right. But that being the case...</b>

01:24.754 --> 01:27.674
<b>If you're thinking about me,
no need to be concerned.</b>

01:27.674 --> 01:30.634
<b>Huh? Alicia, when did you get here?</b>

01:32.094 --> 01:35.724
<b>This sound makes it hard
to believe I'm eating curry.</b>

01:36.844 --> 01:41.394
<b>Anyway, the murder case
needs to take priority, right?</b>

01:41.394 --> 01:47.144
<b>You didn't come here just to make
that perceptive comment, did you?</b>

01:47.144 --> 01:50.444
<b>I want you to let me
help you with this case.</b>

01:50.444 --> 01:53.574
<b>I thought you'd say that.
But absolutely not.</b>

01:53.574 --> 01:55.614
<b>Why not?</b>

01:55.614 --> 01:59.414
<b>Because it's dangerous. Four people
have already turned up dead.</b>

01:59.414 --> 02:03.454
<b>I resolved some cases with Kimizuka
in those two weeks!</b>

02:03.454 --> 02:06.794
<b>Searching for cats, delivering
lost wallets to the police...</b>

02:06.794 --> 02:09.674
<b>Wh-Whether a case is big
or small shouldn't matter!</b>

02:09.674 --> 02:11.004
<b>That's some far-fetched logic.</b>

02:11.004 --> 02:13.294
<b>Far-fetched logic is still logic!</b>

02:15.094 --> 02:18.094
<b>Cool it down a little.</b>

02:18.094 --> 02:21.434
<b>I'm a detective, too.</b>

02:21.434 --> 02:27.144
<b>Alicia, you were a substitute detective.
There's nothing more for you to do.</b>

02:30.394 --> 02:33.654
<b>Hey, Siesta, isn't that
a little too harsh?</b>

02:33.654 --> 02:36.784
<b>What? Are you on her side?</b>

02:36.784 --> 02:38.864
<b>I didn't say that.</b>

02:38.864 --> 02:42.664
<b>Ah, so you are a lolicon after all...</b>

02:42.664 --> 02:45.164
<b>Oh, you're right; that knife's not here.</b>

02:45.164 --> 02:49.714
<b>This isn't the time to go looking
for something dangerous like that.</b>

02:49.714 --> 02:58.594
<b>That's fine. I'll take action in
my own way. I'll solve this case.</b>

02:58.594 --> 03:03.144
<b>And by doing it, I'll prove to you
that I'm a detective, too.</b>

03:03.144 --> 03:05.014
<b>That's how it's going to be.</b>

03:05.014 --> 03:07.854
<b>So I'll look forward to your help
from tomorrow forward, Kimizuka.</b>

03:09.774 --> 03:12.694
<b>Okay, I hear you. Understood.</b>

03:12.694 --> 03:14.904
<b>Yay! That's how it's going to be!</b>

03:14.904 --> 03:18.234
<b>Kimizuka will still be
my sidekick after this!</b>

03:18.234 --> 03:24.574
<b>No, he's my sidekick... Mine...</b>

03:32.624 --> 03:39.964
That was our notification that a fifth
victim had been robbed of a heart.

03:42.004 --> 03:46.064
Episode 8

03:42.004 --> 03:46.064
Episode 8

03:42.004 --> 03:46.054
With That, We Set out on a Journey Once Again

03:42.004 --> 03:46.054
With That, We Set out on a Journey Once Again

03:44.804 --> 03:48.434
<b>Sorry to approach you
so soon after the incident.</b>

03:48.434 --> 03:55.524
<b>Not at all. That's your job, I guess.
If I can be of any help...</b>

03:55.524 --> 03:58.364
<b>I'll prepare some tea...</b>

03:59.824 --> 04:01.694
<b>Are you all right?</b>

04:01.694 --> 04:04.034
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

04:04.034 --> 04:11.624
<b>It's just, it was so sudden...
I still can't believe she's actually gone.</b>

04:15.334 --> 04:21.344
<b>You see, my husband died young, leaving
only my daughter and me for all this time,</b>

04:21.344 --> 04:24.844
<b>so I laid nothing but burden
after burden on her.</b>

04:24.844 --> 04:28.514
<b>And yet she'd say, "I'm going to figure
out how to make a lot of money</b>

04:28.514 --> 04:32.274
<b>and make things easier for you, Mom."</b>

04:32.274 --> 04:37.614
<b>She became truly amazing, and even
had a house like this built for me.</b>

04:37.614 --> 04:42.904
<b>On the day of the incident, did your
daughter behave differently in any way?</b>

04:44.324 --> 04:47.574
<b>Come on, Siesta.</b>

04:47.574 --> 04:52.544
<b>No change in her behavior that
day before she left the house--</b>

04:52.544 --> 04:55.544
<b>Then... anything unusual
when you saw her body?</b>

04:58.504 --> 05:00.344
<b>Siesta.</b>

05:01.674 --> 05:09.354
<b>As a daughter, she was my pride and joy,
better than I ever deserved.</b>

05:09.354 --> 05:14.604
<b>And yet... I was never able
to give her anything.</b>

05:14.604 --> 05:19.484
<b>I only took from her, and the fact
that I'll never be able to repay her...</b>

05:25.404 --> 05:28.494
<b>That's not true!</b>

05:28.494 --> 05:31.624
<b>"Only took," or "only gave"--
there's no way</b>

05:31.624 --> 05:34.794
<b>the relationship could've
been that one-sided!</b>

05:34.794 --> 05:39.254
<b>If you're saying you only received
a lot of things from your daughter,</b>

05:39.254 --> 05:44.884
<b>that had to be because you had already
given a lot of something to her!</b>

05:44.884 --> 05:46.634
<b>Isn't that right?</b>

05:53.724 --> 06:00.194
<b>Thank you. Somehow, I felt as though
it was my daughter saying that to me.</b>

06:11.414 --> 06:15.204
<b>Back there... why did you stop me?</b>

06:16.124 --> 06:20.424
<b>These serial killings are crimes of
opportunity against random victims.</b>

06:20.424 --> 06:23.094
<b>So there shouldn't be any
reason for questions like</b>

06:23.094 --> 06:26.264
<b>whether a victim behaved
differently from usual.</b>

06:26.264 --> 06:28.724
<b>Just because that's been
the case previously,</b>

06:28.724 --> 06:31.514
<b>that doesn't guarantee
that it's the same this time.</b>

06:31.514 --> 06:33.514
<b>Even if only to determine
that this case wasn't an outlier,</b>

06:33.514 --> 06:36.974
<b>it was necessary for me
to ask those questions.</b>

06:39.484 --> 06:42.944
<b>For the sake of taking down Hel,
I'll use any means necessary.</b>

06:42.944 --> 06:46.904
<b>You'll see, I'll run her to ground,
without fail. But you...</b>

06:46.904 --> 06:49.074
<b>You're not like that, Kimi.</b>

06:50.074 --> 06:53.574
<b>Siesta, I'm...</b>

06:53.574 --> 06:58.374
<b>You were the only one I trusted, though.</b>

06:58.374 --> 07:01.214
<b>Siesta...</b>

07:01.214 --> 07:04.384
<b>I'm calling it a day for today. See you.</b>

07:11.344 --> 07:14.724
<b>Stop hiding and come out, Alicia.</b>

07:16.064 --> 07:18.854
<b>Oh, you knew I was here?</b>

07:19.894 --> 07:24.694
<b>Well, how to put it...?
That kind of thing tends to happen.</b>

07:24.694 --> 07:29.744
<b>Traveling together for three whole years,
having a fight or two is only natural.</b>

07:29.744 --> 07:32.154
<b>You could say that <i>not </i>fighting
would be even stranger.</b>

07:32.154 --> 07:34.784
<b>This kind of thing's a common occurrence.</b>

07:34.784 --> 07:39.044
<b>Well, this may be the first time we've had
a serious confrontation like this,</b>

07:39.044 --> 07:44.504
<b>but what about it?
U-Umm, so the thing is...</b>

07:44.504 --> 07:47.804
<b>Wow, you're super worried.</b>

07:47.804 --> 07:52.934
<b>M-Maybe we should quit talking
about this. On another topic...</b>

08:00.434 --> 08:04.104
<b>Huh? Is this... from that time?</b>

08:06.274 --> 08:09.444
<b>Yeah. It's not a thank-you gift, though.</b>

08:11.534 --> 08:19.414
<b>I'm so grateful! It's the first time I've
ever gotten a present from someone.</b>

08:19.414 --> 08:21.954
<b>Alicia, you haven't--</b>

08:21.954 --> 08:26.174
<b>No, I just suspect that's true.</b>

08:26.174 --> 08:31.964
<b>I'm sure that before I lost
my memory, I was a bad kid.</b>

08:38.934 --> 08:42.774
<b>You say that as though
you're not a bad kid now.</b>

08:42.774 --> 08:44.984
<b>Huh? I'm a ridiculously good kid--</b>

08:44.984 --> 08:48.524
<b>lively, cute, upfront,
and loved by everyone!</b>

08:48.524 --> 08:49.444
<b>That's a good one.</b>

08:49.444 --> 08:53.574
<b>It's not a joke! Why, you...</b>

08:54.864 --> 08:56.284
<b>Hey...</b>

08:57.534 --> 09:00.834
<b>Slide this ring on.</b>

09:00.834 --> 09:02.294
<b>Me?</b>

09:02.294 --> 09:03.914
<b>You, Kimizuka.</b>

09:03.914 --> 09:05.374
<b>On you?</b>

09:05.374 --> 09:06.964
<b>On me.</b>

09:17.974 --> 09:20.724
<b>If you put it on the wrong finger,
I'll be mad.</b>

09:20.724 --> 09:26.564
<b>Why on your left hand? Well, after all,
it's just for show, nothing more.</b>

09:35.704 --> 09:37.664
<b>And now your vow.</b>

09:37.664 --> 09:41.664
<b>What, you're a minister now, too?</b>

09:41.664 --> 09:43.624
<b>You're something else.</b>

09:45.544 --> 09:47.374
<b>Well, what to say?</b>

09:47.374 --> 09:55.134
<b>From now on, for a suitable length of
time, we'll work together; this I swear.</b>

09:55.134 --> 09:57.634
<b>That was really wishy-washy, somehow.</b>

09:57.634 --> 10:00.644
<b>Hush. Beggars can't be choosers.</b>

10:09.274 --> 10:12.154
<b>I was too hard on you earlier.</b>

10:12.154 --> 10:14.904
<b>Siesta...</b>

10:14.904 --> 10:18.784
<b>Well, I don't believe I was
wrong in my thinking,</b>

10:18.784 --> 10:21.824
<b>and I also don't think I should
yield the point too readily.</b>

10:21.824 --> 10:27.004
<b>However, you could say I was wrong to try
to force my thinking on you unilaterally.</b>

10:27.004 --> 10:30.294
<b>That said, there are also some aspects
you could stand to rethink, too...</b>

10:30.294 --> 10:36.094
<b>Well, no, I don't mean to rehash what
we talked about, that's not my intent...</b>

10:45.774 --> 10:48.274
<b>I wish you happiness.</b>

10:48.274 --> 10:49.814
<b>Siesta?</b>

10:54.734 --> 11:00.614
<b>Come on... Siesta. Can you hear me?</b>

11:00.614 --> 11:02.824
<b>No, I can't.</b>

11:02.824 --> 11:05.084
<b>What is she, a child?</b>

11:06.124 --> 11:11.674
<b>Hey, Siesta, this whole Alicia thing
is really still a mystery, isn't it?</b>

11:11.674 --> 11:15.214
<b>It's sure a complete mystery to me.</b>

11:19.594 --> 11:22.394
<b>Excuse me. I'm going out for a bit.</b>

11:25.474 --> 11:27.644
<b>My intended's in trouble.</b>

11:40.494 --> 11:41.904
<b>Alicia!</b>

11:44.414 --> 11:45.994
<b>Are you all right?</b>

11:47.704 --> 11:50.254
<b>Kimi... zuka...</b>

11:50.254 --> 11:51.164
<b>Hold on.</b>

11:51.164 --> 11:54.424
<b>The left side of his chest
has been sliced up.</b>

11:54.424 --> 11:59.094
<b>He seems to have lost consciousness,
but I don't think his life is in jeopardy.</b>

12:00.344 --> 12:02.884
<b>This guy is a police officer.</b>

12:04.264 --> 12:06.804
<b>So, Sidekick?</b>

12:06.804 --> 12:09.064
<b>In any case--ambulance!</b>

12:09.974 --> 12:11.524
<b>Hello?</b>

12:12.944 --> 12:16.404
<b>I'm taking Alicia out of here;
you handle this!</b>

12:18.774 --> 12:22.614
<b>Sidekick, is that the path
you want to take?</b>

12:31.454 --> 12:33.714
<b>Really? You, too?</b>

12:37.714 --> 12:38.594
<b>It's sweet.</b>

12:38.594 --> 12:40.174
<b>Helps that you're so straightforward.</b>

12:40.174 --> 12:41.674
<b>It's cute that I'm so
straightforward, you say?</b>

12:41.674 --> 12:44.184
<b>Wait here; I'll borrow something
to clean out your ears.</b>

12:44.184 --> 12:46.394
<b>Isn't that a harsh thing to say
to an injured person?</b>

12:46.394 --> 12:49.974
<b>If you can toss around this
much banter, you're fine.</b>

12:49.974 --> 12:54.104
<b>That aside, Kimizuka, how were you
able to get to that place right away?</b>

12:54.104 --> 12:57.654
<b>Oh, because I'd attached
a tracking device to you.</b>

12:57.654 --> 12:59.984
<b>Oh, I see.</b>

13:02.444 --> 13:05.034
<b>You just offhandedly said a
horrifying thing again, didn't you?!</b>

13:05.034 --> 13:07.284
<b>Don't spit out what you've
had in your mouth...</b>

13:07.284 --> 13:10.244
<b>What do you mean, a tracking device?
That's creepy! Stalker!</b>

13:10.244 --> 13:14.294
<b>You've got it all wrong. Look, you take
off somewhere at the drop of a hat--</b>

13:14.294 --> 13:15.584
<b>this was a precautionary measure.</b>

13:15.584 --> 13:18.584
<b>When, and where did you attach it?</b>

13:18.584 --> 13:22.804
<b>Alicia, you wear surprisingly
gaudy underclothing...</b>

13:23.924 --> 13:28.094
<b>You're the worst!
That's the worst place imaginable!</b>

13:28.094 --> 13:31.314
<b>But thanks to that device,
you got rescued.</b>

13:31.314 --> 13:35.564
<b>See, I can constantly monitor
your health status.</b>

13:36.774 --> 13:39.734
<b>So what were you doing there?</b>

13:41.734 --> 13:46.284
<b>I don't want anyone else to experience
that kind of sadness.</b>

13:46.284 --> 13:50.034
<b>On top of that, it's my job.</b>

13:50.034 --> 13:54.124
<b>Why is it you got so obsessed with this?</b>

13:55.374 --> 13:59.714
<b>I was in a room with no
light or even sound...</b>

13:59.714 --> 14:07.134
<b>A dark, dark, boring world
of nothing but suffering. But...</b>

14:07.134 --> 14:10.684
<b>...one day, suddenly, a wider
world opened up for me.</b>

14:10.684 --> 14:19.484
<b>Light came in, I could hear sounds,
and... I learned how sweet apples were.</b>

14:19.484 --> 14:22.404
<b>I wanted to try a different way of living.</b>

14:22.404 --> 14:27.904
<b>If I could be reborn as a new me, if the
task given to me was to be a detective,</b>

14:27.904 --> 14:31.124
<b>I wanted to live for that and only that.</b>

14:31.124 --> 14:33.034
<b>Alicia...</b>

14:34.584 --> 14:40.174
<b>Maybe I've been talking
too much... I'm feeling sleepy.</b>

14:40.174 --> 14:44.674
<b>I'll stay here until morning, too;
you can rest easy.</b>

14:44.674 --> 14:46.264
<b>Then...</b>

14:47.974 --> 14:51.434
<b>...hold my hand.</b>

14:51.434 --> 14:54.354
<b>Someone will mock you for being
childish... meaning I will.</b>

14:54.354 --> 14:58.484
<b>Feel free to mock me, but hold my hand.</b>

14:58.484 --> 15:02.864
<b>If such is your command...
legendary detective.</b>

15:40.064 --> 15:42.694
<b>What are you doing in this place?</b>

15:44.564 --> 15:50.574
<b>Just what I need to ask you.
I only came to look for Hel.</b>

15:50.574 --> 15:53.574
<b>Why'd you think Hel would come here?</b>

15:53.574 --> 15:57.084
<b>You've realized it by now,
too, haven't you?</b>

15:57.084 --> 15:59.164
<b>Realized what?</b>

15:59.164 --> 16:05.464
<b>The perpetrator is looking for hearts--
no, is <i>only </i>after hearts.</b>

16:05.464 --> 16:10.264
<b>Yeah. And today, that police officer
was on the verge of being a victim.</b>

16:10.264 --> 16:14.394
<b>That's right. That officer sustained
a wound on the left side of the chest.</b>

16:14.394 --> 16:16.804
<b>Without question he was attacked by Hel.</b>

16:16.804 --> 16:22.444
<b>But why was she--Alicia--
wounded in her right shoulder?</b>

16:22.444 --> 16:25.864
<b>Why was she shot by that officer?</b>

16:25.864 --> 16:29.944
<b>Was the shot not fired in self-defense?</b>

16:31.404 --> 16:35.324
<b>Get out of my way, Siesta. I have to...</b>

16:39.164 --> 16:43.584
<b>Didn't you recognize the knife
that was dropped at the scene?</b>

16:43.584 --> 16:48.714
<b>I don't know what you're talking about.
I didn't check every little thing.</b>

16:48.714 --> 16:54.014
<b>It was unquestionably the knife
that was at our place.</b>

16:54.014 --> 16:57.184
<b>What really matters is that
we find Alicia right away!</b>

16:57.184 --> 17:00.104
<b>You had to have known, too.</b>

17:01.394 --> 17:05.394
<b>What's the real reason you put
a tracking device in that ring?</b>

17:05.394 --> 17:06.944
<b>Stop it!</b>

17:07.904 --> 17:12.284
<b>Alicia being Hel... That's just not--</b>

17:13.574 --> 17:19.164
<b>Then what about the impostor Fuubi-<i>san</i>?
At first you said that was Hel, right?</b>

17:19.164 --> 17:21.494
<b>And yet Alicia was there, too.</b>

17:21.494 --> 17:24.754
<b>Alicia herself is Hel, transformed.</b>

17:24.754 --> 17:29.674
<b>And so we have to assume that
impostor was another adversary.</b>

17:29.674 --> 17:33.384
<b>You're saying there's
another one like Hel?</b>

17:33.384 --> 17:36.094
<b>It seems reasonable to think so.</b>

17:36.094 --> 17:39.514
<b>Some sort of ringleader
over them all, for example.</b>

17:39.514 --> 17:41.314
<b>That's ludicrous.</b>

17:41.314 --> 17:43.894
<b>But Hel comes first.</b>

17:45.434 --> 17:48.694
<b>We have to find Hel, quickly.</b>

17:48.694 --> 17:55.574
<b>You mean Alicia! She's not Hel;
she's Alicia! She's... She's...</b>

17:55.574 --> 17:57.864
<b>Immediately after Hel was
wounded in the heart,</b>

17:57.864 --> 18:00.494
<b>the opportunist killer
harvesting hearts appeared.</b>

18:00.494 --> 18:07.624
<b>At that very time, an unidentified girl
appeared in front of us. So, Sidekick...</b>

18:07.624 --> 18:12.384
<b>...are you going to insist that this is all
consistent with being just coincidence?</b>

18:13.344 --> 18:16.594
<b>Did you know from the beginning?</b>

18:16.594 --> 18:20.184
<b>No. If I had realized earlier,</b>

18:20.184 --> 18:23.014
<b>we wouldn't have allowed
so many to become victims.</b>

18:23.014 --> 18:27.564
<b>Yet I was utterly unable to distrust her.</b>

18:28.694 --> 18:33.864
<b>But it's ridiculous. Are you saying
everything about Alicia was a lie?</b>

18:33.864 --> 18:37.864
<b>So those shrieks, the words
she said to that mother...</b>

18:37.864 --> 18:40.034
<b>...you're saying those
were all faked, too?</b>

18:40.034 --> 18:46.454
<b>I think they were real. That woman was
definitely helped by Alicia's words.</b>

18:49.254 --> 18:52.884
<b>At that moment, inside the
left side of Alicia's chest...</b>

18:52.884 --> 18:55.344
<b>...that woman's daughter's...</b>

18:55.344 --> 18:59.014
<b>I'm sorry. Guess I'm disqualified
from being a legendary detective.</b>

19:02.054 --> 19:04.764
<b>Alicia...</b>

19:04.764 --> 19:09.444
<b>You see, it seems that inside of me,
there's one more me.</b>

19:09.444 --> 19:16.114
<b>I'm the behind-the-scenes one, so I have
no memories and don't know who I am.</b>

19:16.114 --> 19:21.614
<b>That's why I kept saying
the real me was 17 years old.</b>

19:21.614 --> 19:27.914
<b>Honestly, on some level I realized it.
But I pretended not to know...</b>

19:27.914 --> 19:31.544
<b>...that the other me was
committing these crimes.</b>

19:31.544 --> 19:39.224
<b>But for some reason, as Kimizuka and I
carried on the investigation, I prayed...</b>

19:39.224 --> 19:42.764
<b>...that someone else might be
the culprit--that it had to be true.</b>

19:42.764 --> 19:44.474
<b>Alicia!</b>

19:45.854 --> 19:47.934
<b>You're not bad.</b>

19:47.934 --> 19:50.184
<b>You may be somewhat self-centered,</b>

19:50.184 --> 19:52.854
<b>and you've been the
source of a lot of trouble,</b>

19:52.854 --> 19:55.444
<b>but you're a kind human being, Alicia.</b>

19:55.444 --> 19:58.284
<b>You can share in people's
joy and heartbreak.</b>

19:58.284 --> 20:02.204
<b>You're even capable of getting
angry for, or crying for, others.</b>

20:02.204 --> 20:04.784
<b>Alicia, you're not...</b>

20:04.784 --> 20:09.794
<b>I knew it was an impossible
hope. Yet still...</b>

20:09.794 --> 20:17.754
<b>Kimizuka. Thank you.
It was a short time, but it was fun.</b>

20:19.634 --> 20:24.514
<b>Honestly, I wanted to do
more detective work...</b>

20:26.304 --> 20:29.684
<b>...but I can't stay with you anymore.</b>

20:29.684 --> 20:34.064
<b>I only wanted Alicia
to remain as Alicia...</b>

20:34.064 --> 20:41.574
<b>In truth, I was never... anything but bad.</b>

20:41.574 --> 20:44.914
<b>I was wishing only for that miracle!</b>

20:53.504 --> 20:54.674
<b>Alicia!</b>

20:54.674 --> 20:56.004
<b>Sidekick!</b>

21:06.594 --> 21:07.644
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

21:07.644 --> 21:09.764
<b>Don't do it, Siesta!</b>

21:10.934 --> 21:15.524
<b>Are you stupid or something, Kimi?
This has to be done here and now...</b>

21:15.524 --> 21:21.484
<b>Don't you understand that these emotions
will warp your crucial decisions?</b>

21:21.484 --> 21:27.074
<b>Didn't you just learn recently that
that's what being human is?</b>

21:33.164 --> 21:36.464
<b>My, my, are you two having a falling out?</b>

21:44.764 --> 21:48.644
<b>At last I've found her. So troublesome...</b>

21:48.644 --> 21:52.064
<b>Here I believed she'd just strayed
when my attention was elsewhere,</b>

21:52.064 --> 21:57.604
<b>but she'd not only changed form,
but also lost her memory...</b>

21:57.604 --> 22:01.944
<b>Chameleon! Where do you
intend to take Alicia?</b>

22:01.944 --> 22:06.784
<b>Well, now. Approximately 700
nautical miles northwest of here</b>

22:06.784 --> 22:10.204
<b>is a solitary island we use as a base.</b>

22:10.204 --> 22:15.584
<b>If you're saying you mean to come for her,
we'll be awaiting you there.</b>

22:15.584 --> 22:17.084
<b>Wait!</b>

22:31.474 --> 22:34.224
<b>I thought I'd been shot.</b>

22:37.234 --> 22:39.234
<b>Are you stupid or something, Kimi?</b>

22:41.564 --> 22:44.694
<b>I'm not going to apologize, you know.</b>

22:44.694 --> 22:48.744
<b>It's fine if you don't.</b>

22:48.744 --> 22:51.324
<b>You were trying
to do the right thing,</b>

22:51.324 --> 22:54.664
<b>and I was also trying
to do the right thing.</b>

22:54.664 --> 23:00.924
<b>So you won't apologize,
and neither will I. It's fine that way.</b>

23:03.504 --> 23:06.134
<b>What do we do now?</b>

23:08.934 --> 23:11.894
<b>Let's go to a grocery store first.</b>

23:11.894 --> 23:19.024
<b>And let's buy the biggest,
reddest, roundest apples.</b>

23:19.024 --> 23:25.864
<b>Then we'll make lots of delicious apple
pie and brew some outstanding tea.</b>

23:25.864 --> 23:27.574
<b>And then...</b>

23:29.954 --> 23:34.664
<b>...we'll set out on a journey...
to rescue our comrade.</b>

